{"strongs": "H1755", "word": "דּוֺר", "translit": "dor", "root": "דור", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "period, generation, dwelling", "definition": "I. דּוֺר , דֹּר noun masculine Deut 32:5 period, generation, dwelling (compare below verb above; also Late Hebrew דּוֺר , Aramaic (included Biblical Aramaic) דָּר , , age, generation ; Arabic gyrus, orbis, periodus ; Sabean דר , one time, once , דרם דרם each once in a year DHM in MV ) — absolute דּוֺר Gen 7:1 + 68 t.; דֹּר Exod 3:15 36 t.; construct דּוֺר Deut 32:20 + 7 t., דֹּר Exod 3:15 suffix דּוֺרִי Isa 38:12 , דּוֺרוֺ Isa 53:8 plural דּוֺרִים Ps 72:5 + 2 t., דֹּרוֺת absolute Job 42:16 ; Isa 41:4 construct Judg 3:2 דּוֺרוֺת construct Isa 51:9 , דֹּרֹת Gen 9:12 suffix דֹּרֹתָיו Gen 6:9 ; Lev 25:30 , דּוֺרוֺתֵינוּ Josh 22:27 , דֹּרֹתֵינוּ v Josh 22:28 , דּרֹתֵיכֶם Gen 17:12 + 27 t., דֹּרֹתָם Gen 17:7 + 10 t.; — 1. period, age, generation , mostly poetic: \\ \\ a. of duration in the past, former age(s) דּוֺרוֺת עוֺלָמִים Isa 51:9 (|| קדם ימי ); שְׁנוֺת דֹּר וָדֹר Deut 32:7 (song; || ימות עולם ); בְּדֹר וָדֹר Ps 90:1 (compare v Ps 90:2 ); מוֺסְדֵי דּוֺרוָֿדוֺר Isa 58:12 (|| חרבות עולם ); שֹׁמֲמוֺת דּוֺר וָדוֺר Isa 61:4 (|| id. ) \\ \\ b. usually of duration to come, future age(s) , לְדֹר דֹּר Exod 3:15 ( E ; || לעולם ) compare Prov 27:24 Kt ( Qr לְדוֺר וָדוֺר ; || id. ); מִדֹּר דֹּר Exod 17:16 ( E ), = מִדּוֺר לָדוֺר Isa 34:10 לְדֹר וָדֹר Ps 10:6 ; Ps 33:11 (|| לעולם ) Ps 49:12 ; Ps 79:13 ; Ps 85:6 ; Ps 102:13 ; Ps 119:90 ; Ps 135:13 ; Ps 146:10 ; Joel 4:20 (all || id. ); Ps 89:2 (|| עולם ) Ps 89:5 (|| עדעֿולם ) Ps 106:31 (|| id. ) Isa 34:17 (|| id. ); Ps 77:9 (|| לנצח ); עַדדֹּֿר וָדֹר Ps 100:5 (|| לעולם ) Isa 13:20 (|| לנצח ) Jer 50:39 (|| id. ); בְּכָלדֹּֿר וָדֹר Jer 45:18 (|| לעולם ועד ) compare Esth 9:28 שְׁנוֺתָיו כְּמוֺ דֹר וָדֹר Ps 61:7 compare שְׁנֵי דּוֺר וָדוֺר Joel 2:2 (|| העולם ); as modifying phrase מְשׂוֺשׂ דּוֺר וָדוֺר Isa 60:15 (|| נאון עולם ); further דּוֺר דּוֺרִים Ps 72:5 יְשׁוּעָתִי לְדוֺר דּוֺרִים Isa 51:8 (|| לעולם ). \\ \\ c. apparently including both past and future בְּדוֺר דּוֺרִים שְׁנוֺתֶיךָ Ps 102:25 בְּכָל דּוֺר וָדֹר Ps 145:13 לְדוֺר וָדוֺר Lam 5:19 . 2. of men living at a particular time (period, age), generation , as transitory דּוֺר הֹלֵךְ וְדוֺר בָּא Eccl 1:4 : specifically \\ \\ a. in the present, and (or) the past Gen 7:1 ( J ) Exod 1:6 ( P ) Num 32:13 ( J E ) Deut 1:35 ; Deut 2:14 ; Judg 2:10 (twice in verse); Isa 53:8 (compare Che critical note) Jer 2:31 also Ps 95:10 ; Job 8:8 ; Isa 41:4 . \\ \\ b. Judg 3:2 (present & future); compare plural דֹּרֹתָיו Gen 6:9 (i.e. his own generation and those immediately contiguous, before and after). \\ \\ c. especially of a future generation Gen 15:16 ( J E ), with numeral, compare Deut 23:3 ; Deut 23:4 ; Deut 23:9 also Deut 29:21 ; Ps 48:14 ; Ps 71:18 ; Ps 78:4 ; Ps 78:6 ; Ps 102:19 ; Ps 109:13 ; Joel 1:3 compare Ps 22:31 ; Ps 22:32 ( Che critical note ); of a succession of generations דּוֺר לְדוֺר יְשַׂבַּח מַעֲשֶׂיךָ Ps 145:4 בְּכָלדּֿוֺר וָדוֺר Esth 9:28 usually plural לְדֹרֹת עוֺלָם Gen 9:12 ( P ); with number לְאֶלֶף דּוֺר Ps 105:8 (|| עולם ) = 1Chr 16:15 (|| לעולם ); Deut 7:9 see further, of posterity, אַרְבָּעָה דֹּרוֺת Job 42:16 usually plural with suffix Gen 17:7 ; Gen 17:9 ; Gen 17:12 ; Exod 12:14 ; Exod 12:17 ; Exod 12:42 ; Exod 16:32 ; Exod 16:33 ; Exod 27:21 ; Exod 29:42 ; Exod 30:8 ; Exod 30:10 ; Exod 30:21 ; Exod 30:31 ; Exod 31:13 ; Exod 31:16 ; Exod 40:15 ; Lev 3:17 ; Lev 6:11 ; Lev 7:36 ; Lev 10:9 (all P ); Lev 17:7 ; Lev 21:17 ; Lev 22:3 ; Lev 23:14 ; Lev 23:21 ; Lev 23:31 ; Lev 23:41 ; Lev 23:43 ; Lev 24:3 ; Lev 25:30 (all H ); Num 9:10 ; Num 10:8 ; Num 15:14 ; Num 15:15 ; Num 15:21 ; Num 15:23 ; Num 15:38 ; Num 18:23 ; Num 35:29 ; Josh 22:27 ; Josh 22:28 (all P ). 3. generation characterized by quality or condition, class of men: דּוֺר עִקֵּשׁ crooked generation Deut 32:5 (song) compare v Deut 32:20 ; Ps 78:8 (twice in verse); Jer 7:29 of different classes of wicked, Prov 30:11 ; Prov 30:12 ; Prov 30:13 ; Prov 30:14 compare Ps 12:8 of the righteous, as a class Ps 14:5 ; Ps 24:6 ; Ps 73:15 ( בָּנֶיךָ דּוֺר ) Ps 112:2 (compare Ps 22:31 ᵑ0 , but < Che joins לדור to v Ps 22:32 compare above below 2 c ); so also דּוֺר אֲבוֺתָיו i.e. the dead Ps 49:20 (so most; yet see below below 4 ). 4. dwelling-place, habitation Isa 38:12 compare דּוּר verb, so Saad Ki Ges De Che RVm ( Ew life || חַיַּי ); so also Ps 49:20 De Witt, compare Che OP 479 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1892')\">BDB1892</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1755')\">H1755</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1891')\">BDB1891</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1893')\">BDB1893</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>דּוֺר</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>דֹּר</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Deut 32:5\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,5)\">Deut 32:5</ref></sup> <highlightword>period, generation, dwelling</highlightword> (compare below <b>verb</b> above; also Late Hebrew <bdbheb>דּוֺר</bdbheb>, Aramaic (included Biblical Aramaic) <bdbheb>דָּר</bdbheb>, <placeholder1117/>, <highlight>age, generation</highlight>; Arabic <placeholder1118/> <highlight>gyrus, orbis, periodus</highlight>; Sabean <bdbheb>דר</bdbheb>, <highlight>one time, once</highlight>, <bdbheb>דרם דרם</bdbheb> <highlight>each once</highlight> in a year <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('DHM')\">DHM</lookup> in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('MV')\">MV</lookup>) — absolute <bdbheb>דּוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 7:1\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,1)\">Gen 7:1</ref> + 68 t.; <bdbheb>דֹּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 3:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,3,15)\">Exod 3:15</ref> 36 t.; construct <bdbheb>דּוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 32:20\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,20)\">Deut 32:20</ref> + 7 t